WEBVTT

00:03.253 --> 00:05.588
<i>Causes of death are many and varied.</i>

00:06.089 --> 00:09.676
<i>Old age, suicide, illness…</i>

00:09.759 --> 00:14.180
<i>But the cause of death that scares</i>
<i>the most people in this day and age…</i>

00:18.101 --> 00:19.477
<i>…is death by fire.</i>

00:41.708 --> 00:43.752
Just a moment!

00:46.588 --> 00:50.383
I am Moonlight Mask.

02:31.359 --> 02:32.443
Matoi…

02:33.903 --> 02:35.572
That outfit…

02:35.655 --> 02:37.282
Benimaru from the 7th?

02:38.658 --> 02:41.578
I am Moonlight Mask.

02:42.787 --> 02:47.750
Asakusa may be independent,
but we can't make an enemy of the Empire.

02:47.834 --> 02:51.588
So what? Damn it,
do I have to wear this thing?

02:51.671 --> 02:54.883
Wear the happi coat collar backwards too.

02:54.966 --> 02:58.261
Listen well, Waka. This line'll keep
them from figuring you out.

02:58.845 --> 03:01.180
<i>"Just a moment!"</i>

03:02.807 --> 03:04.934
Just a moment!

03:05.018 --> 03:06.811
I am Moonlight--

03:06.895 --> 03:08.354
Captain Shinmon!

03:15.445 --> 03:17.947
Grab onto the matoi while you've got time.

03:28.458 --> 03:29.876
What is that?

03:31.085 --> 03:34.339
All of the heat within four meters of him…

03:35.215 --> 03:37.091
is under his control?

03:38.676 --> 03:39.928
The Moon…

03:40.011 --> 03:41.012
Moonlight…

03:42.096 --> 03:44.140
Just a moment?

03:44.807 --> 03:46.100
What's that mean anyway?

03:55.193 --> 03:57.570
Good job holding on, Obi.

03:57.654 --> 04:00.490
That was close. I thought I was a goner.

04:00.573 --> 04:03.785
Let's go.
The White-Clad have us surrounded.

04:04.577 --> 04:07.247
Shinra! Where's Captain Burns?

04:08.164 --> 04:10.750
A demon… in front of my eyes…

04:11.709 --> 04:14.587
Captain Burns got done in…

04:17.632 --> 04:19.425
I couldn't defend him.

04:20.551 --> 04:22.804
When he said it was in my hands…

04:28.393 --> 04:33.439
I see. So Captain Burns
left it in your hands.

04:34.774 --> 04:39.112
Captain Burns accepted
everything I gave him.

04:40.071 --> 04:44.617
Captain Burns fought for the sake
of this country until the end.

04:49.789 --> 04:52.166
Let's defend this country.

04:53.501 --> 04:56.004
<i>Right now… I…</i>

04:56.629 --> 05:00.383
<i>This… is warm…</i>

05:01.676 --> 05:03.428
<i>A big back…</i>

05:04.512 --> 05:06.681
<i>I feel so relieved…</i>

05:07.390 --> 05:09.976
<i>This world… This country…</i>

05:10.768 --> 05:12.270
<i>It should be this way…</i>

05:13.646 --> 05:16.399
You guys grab onto the matoi too!
We're outta here!

05:18.901 --> 05:21.321
I feel like a real witch!

05:24.157 --> 05:25.742
Captain Obi! You're safe!

05:26.326 --> 05:29.912
Yeah! Thanks for coming,
Lieutenant Hinawa!

05:29.996 --> 05:31.789
You folks go on ahead.

05:36.919 --> 05:39.464
Strongest, you're outta here too.
I'll cover you.

05:39.547 --> 05:43.634
Just when people who'd be
worth a fight are all here.

05:43.718 --> 05:46.345
You might be strong,
but you can't do it alone--

05:46.429 --> 05:47.889
Actually, maybe you could.

05:48.598 --> 05:51.851
Who knows? They've got a bad dude here.

05:54.645 --> 05:56.856
Iai Chop, Form One…

05:57.982 --> 05:59.025
Fire Moon!

06:01.319 --> 06:03.279
Counter!

06:06.324 --> 06:08.493
Just great. They're all monsters.

06:14.832 --> 06:17.168
Iai Chop, Form Seven:

06:17.752 --> 06:19.253
Sun Wheel.

06:22.757 --> 06:24.300
Did a mosquito bite me?

06:25.510 --> 06:26.761
A real monster.

06:26.844 --> 06:28.221
Hey, quit playing around.

06:29.972 --> 06:31.891
Iai Chop, Form Two:

06:32.725 --> 06:33.726
Moonlight!

06:38.731 --> 06:41.109
Everything went perfectly.

06:41.776 --> 06:45.029
Everything went exactly as you planned.

06:45.113 --> 06:46.489
Right?

06:46.572 --> 06:47.573
Yeah.

06:47.657 --> 06:52.537
Amaterasu, me, Sho, Shinra,

06:52.620 --> 06:56.207
Inca, Nataku, plus her…

06:56.707 --> 06:59.836
Today, all of the Pillars have assembled.

07:00.545 --> 07:03.381
Everything has been assembled.

07:04.423 --> 07:06.592
Begin final preparations immediately.

07:07.468 --> 07:12.014
The day this planet burns out is nigh.

07:15.143 --> 07:18.271
ASAKUSA

07:18.855 --> 07:20.189
He's back?

07:21.774 --> 07:22.733
Waka!

07:22.817 --> 07:24.986
Ah! I mean Moonlight Mask--

07:25.069 --> 07:26.028
Shut up.

07:26.654 --> 07:29.740
We've got some injured men.
Get them treated.

07:29.824 --> 07:32.493
Looks like you're safe, Obi.

07:32.994 --> 07:34.412
Is Shinra all right?

07:34.495 --> 07:36.497
Yes. Take care of him.

07:36.581 --> 07:38.958
His life isn't in danger.

07:39.041 --> 07:41.502
This guy's wound is deep! Hop to it!

07:41.586 --> 07:43.045
Hang in there, Arthur!

07:43.629 --> 07:45.548
I stopped the bleeding
with an emergency spray!

07:45.631 --> 07:46.841
Get him ready for an operation!

07:46.924 --> 07:49.427
Carry them gently! No sharp moves!

07:49.510 --> 07:51.721
We'll examine the rest
of the crewmen over here!

07:51.804 --> 07:53.931
Thank you for accepting us here.

07:54.015 --> 07:58.227
If you hadn't come to save us,
we all would've been doomed.

07:58.728 --> 08:02.231
We exchanged saké cups with the 8th.

08:02.732 --> 08:04.609
What the hell happened in the Empire?

08:05.359 --> 08:07.069
Tell me what's going on.

08:10.448 --> 08:14.035
The Holy Sol Temple and the Evangelist's
people have joined forces.

08:14.619 --> 08:18.748
As a result, the 8th has been
isolated from the Empire.

08:19.874 --> 08:22.460
Look like your hunch was right.

08:22.543 --> 08:26.214
I'm always wrong when I gamble.
I'm only right with these things.

08:29.717 --> 08:32.178
Is what you said earlier true?

08:32.261 --> 08:37.391
Yes. Captain Burns from
the 1st has been martyred.

08:38.059 --> 08:40.228
You said he was done in by a demon.

08:40.728 --> 08:44.106
Was it one of the "doppelgangers"
that Hibana mentioned?

08:45.858 --> 08:50.988
But the murder of Captain Burns
will be pinned on the 8th.

08:51.781 --> 08:54.867
Then the union between the Empire

08:54.951 --> 08:56.869
and the White-Clad will grow
even stronger.

08:56.953 --> 09:00.164
It'll be the worst possible result.

09:00.248 --> 09:03.960
What was Burns after when
he went out for the fight?

09:04.043 --> 09:06.462
Was it to isolate the 8th?

09:07.171 --> 09:11.425
No, that's not the man he was.

09:11.509 --> 09:14.387
SPECIAL FIRE GRAND CATHEDRAL 1

09:19.850 --> 09:23.312
Burns, rest in peace.

09:23.813 --> 09:25.022
<i>Látom</i>.

09:27.024 --> 09:30.570
What's the point of praying
to an empty casket?

09:33.864 --> 09:37.994
<i>Captain Burns's funeral</i>
<i>was conducted only within the 1st.</i>

09:38.786 --> 09:44.458
<i>They said that he was martyred while</i>
<i>pursuing the wanted criminal Akitaru Obi.</i>

09:44.542 --> 09:49.046
<i>The cause of death was stated as</i>
<i>a homicide committed by Shinra Kusakabe.</i>

09:49.130 --> 09:52.967
<i>The 8th was reframed fully as insurgents.</i>

09:53.050 --> 09:55.803
<i>They became enemies of the Empire.</i>

09:56.554 --> 09:58.472
Not a chance in hell!

09:58.556 --> 10:03.811
Karim, do you remember
Captain Burns's final words?

10:03.894 --> 10:06.063
I'd never forget.

10:09.483 --> 10:11.777
Karim, Huo Yan,

10:12.486 --> 10:15.990
for all my life I have only prayed.

10:16.741 --> 10:19.285
I cannot change my way of life anymore.

10:22.997 --> 10:26.000
The ones
who will change the world are you.

10:26.834 --> 10:29.128
Think critically about what is
going to happen from now on.

10:30.212 --> 10:32.089
Take care of the 1st in my absence.

10:35.092 --> 10:39.096
I will go to Fuchu to convey this.

10:42.308 --> 10:46.604
I'm sorry for being a stubborn
and irresponsible old man.

10:53.527 --> 10:56.197
SPECIAL FIRE FORCE COMPANY 5 COMBINE

10:59.909 --> 11:02.036
Princess, where are you going?

11:03.037 --> 11:06.457
Captain Burns was trying
to change something.

11:06.540 --> 11:10.336
We need to defend
the 1st that the captain built.

11:10.419 --> 11:12.838
It's our turn to take responsibility.

11:12.922 --> 11:14.548
What are you going to do?

11:14.632 --> 11:15.966
Returning…

11:16.050 --> 11:18.219
There's a place I need to go.

11:18.302 --> 11:20.221
…to where I was raised.

11:20.805 --> 11:21.931
And that's…

11:24.975 --> 11:27.520
…the St. Raffles Convent.

11:35.820 --> 11:37.988
<i>The St. Raffles Convent.</i>

11:38.989 --> 11:41.450
<i>The convent's symbol combines</i>

11:41.534 --> 11:45.413
<i>the Holy Sol Cross</i>
<i>with vegetation and flowers.</i>

11:46.205 --> 11:51.168
<i>It has thus received 113 young girls</i>
<i>who had nowhere to call home</i>

11:51.252 --> 11:54.380
<i>and raised them as sisters of the faith.</i>

11:55.881 --> 11:58.634
<i>The sisters offer prayers.</i>

11:59.301 --> 12:02.638
<i>Every day, intently, from the heart,</i>

12:02.721 --> 12:05.057
<i>full of gratitude, to God.</i>

12:08.561 --> 12:13.315
<i>Each day has three meals, in the morning,</i>
<i>at noon, and in the evening.</i>

12:14.358 --> 12:17.027
<i>The meals are primarily of</i>

12:17.111 --> 12:20.197
<i>healthy, nutritious vegetables grown</i>
<i>with plentiful sunlight.</i>

12:21.282 --> 12:25.911
<i>Naturally, the sisters</i>
<i>grow them all by hand.</i>

12:26.954 --> 12:30.666
<i>Based on the convent's</i>
<i>symbol and this practice,</i>

12:30.749 --> 12:35.379
<i>it became tradition for all of</i>
<i>the sisters to be named after plants.</i>

12:40.634 --> 12:44.930
Sister Sakura, try not to
play too many pranks.

12:45.514 --> 12:50.019
Sister Clematis, try not to
be picky with your food.

12:50.811 --> 12:55.774
Sister Sumire, please take care
of the girls on the other side.

13:00.029 --> 13:01.614
ST. RAFFLES CONVENT RUINS

13:01.697 --> 13:06.076
Is the secret behind
doppelgangers hidden here?

13:08.120 --> 13:09.997
But why would they…

13:10.498 --> 13:13.083
Kishiri, you wait here.

13:13.667 --> 13:16.045
I'm supposed to be a guard.
I can't leave you--

13:16.128 --> 13:18.672
Defiled gravel does not enter the convent.

13:19.465 --> 13:21.675
I'll call you if anything happens.

13:22.384 --> 13:25.971
When we came all the way out
to the edge of the Empire…

13:26.055 --> 13:28.599
She sure is cold.

13:30.601 --> 13:32.853
Oh, done with training?

13:32.937 --> 13:35.731
That training's nothing
once you're as good as me.

13:35.814 --> 13:37.775
On that note, how about dinner tonight?

13:37.858 --> 13:42.321
I know the owner of the
hardest-to-book restaurant in the Empire.

13:42.404 --> 13:44.198
I can specially take you there.

13:44.281 --> 13:45.866
Well? How about it?

13:47.701 --> 13:52.331
A man trying to show off
but talking constantly of himself.

13:52.414 --> 13:55.793
Only a fool of a girl
would get taken in by that.

13:55.876 --> 13:59.338
What's up? What's up?
Curious about what I'm up to?

13:59.421 --> 14:02.591
And that hair is disgusting
and repulsive. Cut it.

14:02.675 --> 14:04.718
Nothing is more disgraceful
than an ugly man in desperation.

14:08.472 --> 14:13.227
Well, I don't need to straighten it
every morning anymore.

14:13.310 --> 14:16.564
It's proof that
the captain cares about me.

14:16.647 --> 14:17.648
Wait, hold on!

14:17.731 --> 14:20.359
Gravel! Disgusting! Ugly!

14:20.442 --> 14:21.986
But the truth is…

14:22.069 --> 14:23.863
She loves me?!

14:23.946 --> 14:25.739
Hold me tight! Tighter!

14:25.823 --> 14:27.700
He's so disgusting.

14:27.783 --> 14:30.578
Why are there only
disgusting men in the 5th?

14:40.254 --> 14:42.214
Sister Clematis, this way!

14:42.298 --> 14:44.049
Wait!

14:45.259 --> 14:46.635
Sister Hibana!

14:47.928 --> 14:50.556
They said there was
a honeybee hive over this way!

14:50.639 --> 14:54.560
What? A honeybee hive? That's dangerous!

14:54.643 --> 14:57.897
That's why we want you to come with us!

15:00.316 --> 15:02.526
Iris, will you come with us?

15:04.153 --> 15:05.112
But…

15:05.195 --> 15:08.741
Are you sure? Sister Iris, it's dangerous.

15:08.824 --> 15:10.534
Don't worry!

15:11.160 --> 15:13.329
I'll protect you!

15:13.913 --> 15:14.788
So it's okay, right?

15:18.584 --> 15:20.628
It's on top of that tree.

15:20.711 --> 15:22.796
Are you sure it's okay?

15:22.880 --> 15:24.465
Let's approach it carefully.

15:25.758 --> 15:27.426
I heard all of that.

15:28.218 --> 15:31.305
Going near a beehive…

15:31.388 --> 15:34.016
Hey, what's wrong with that,
Sister Sumire?

15:34.099 --> 15:35.935
We just want to see it.

15:36.018 --> 15:39.813
That may be true, but it is time to pray.

15:39.897 --> 15:41.398
Do it some other time.

15:41.982 --> 15:44.026
Okay…

15:45.527 --> 15:47.738
We're going to see it
as soon as we're done!

15:47.821 --> 15:48.989
Sakura, are you serious?

15:49.073 --> 15:51.033
I heard that too.

16:00.501 --> 16:03.837
Sakura was always causing trouble…

16:05.297 --> 16:06.382
The memories.

16:06.966 --> 16:09.969
We were sisters, but we were
also young children.

16:10.594 --> 16:13.430
It must have been difficult
for Sister Sumire.

16:22.147 --> 16:25.275
<i>Only Iris and I survived.</i>

16:27.069 --> 16:32.449
<i>I swore, in the name of St. John's</i>
<i>wort, to have my revenge!</i>

16:47.297 --> 16:50.884
Nothing of the building
above ground remains.

16:50.968 --> 16:52.511
Which means…

16:54.013 --> 16:55.264
The Nether…

16:58.142 --> 17:03.230
If there is a large cavity underground,
the frequency should decrease.

17:03.731 --> 17:04.565
Where is it?

17:18.412 --> 17:20.289
The frequency decreased!

17:20.372 --> 17:23.292
No doubt about it.
There's a cavity beneath me!

17:24.168 --> 17:26.336
This is the dining hall.

17:28.047 --> 17:30.966
There must be an entrance
to the Nether near here.

17:31.050 --> 17:33.886
Somewhere the sisters would never go near…

17:35.763 --> 17:37.139
The altar?

17:37.723 --> 17:40.434
The sisters would never
touch it without permission.

17:41.060 --> 17:43.020
Beneath this altar?

17:43.645 --> 17:47.649
But how do I move something this large?

17:49.068 --> 17:49.860
You gravel!

17:52.279 --> 17:53.906
Not even an inch.

17:55.074 --> 17:57.367
But this altar…

17:57.451 --> 17:58.577
What was it called again?

17:58.660 --> 18:00.579
The Altar of Sacrifice, right?

18:01.288 --> 18:03.582
Are you really a former sister?

18:04.166 --> 18:05.959
What are you people doing here?

18:06.043 --> 18:08.921
We called you with a few questions.

18:09.004 --> 18:11.507
Me? And you came all the way here to--

18:11.590 --> 18:14.134
We have some questions
about "doppelgangers."

18:15.719 --> 18:17.221
You too?

18:20.599 --> 18:24.061
Damn that Kishiri!
Letting you people through…

18:24.144 --> 18:26.605
Whatever. You can see
the situation for yourselves.

18:27.189 --> 18:30.150
I found that there is something
beneath this altar,

18:30.234 --> 18:33.278
but I was standing here
with no way to move it.

18:33.362 --> 18:37.533
I'll do something about that.
Can you light a fire under the altar?

18:37.616 --> 18:39.243
Are you giving me orders?

18:40.494 --> 18:41.495
I will do it.

18:41.578 --> 18:43.455
No, I'll do it.

18:43.997 --> 18:46.291
Rose whip, creep about!

18:47.251 --> 18:49.169
Thermo-Acoustic Cooling.

18:56.135 --> 18:57.928
What have we found?

19:01.849 --> 19:03.934
So there was a staircase
descending into the ground!

19:04.017 --> 19:06.353
Why would there be
one in a sacred convent?

19:10.774 --> 19:13.777
It seems the fire had
no effect beneath the ground.

19:13.861 --> 19:16.738
Great Sol, please forgive us.

19:23.162 --> 19:26.290
A place like this underground?

19:26.957 --> 19:30.169
This goes against the teachings
of the Holy Sol Temple.

19:30.252 --> 19:34.089
It was just as we surmised,
but I wish that we were wrong.

19:35.424 --> 19:40.804
Eight pillars. The same as the number
of Pillars with Adolla Bursts.

19:40.888 --> 19:43.515
It smells fishy as a smelly fish.

19:47.519 --> 19:49.938
<i>The secret of human combustion is here.</i>

19:50.439 --> 19:54.359
<i>The fire at the convent</i>
<i>was brought about intentionally.</i>

19:55.485 --> 19:57.654
<i>The evidence must be here somewhere.</i>

19:58.780 --> 20:00.616
A book on plants?

20:00.699 --> 20:03.702
There is also a textbook
on growing crops here.

20:03.785 --> 20:07.331
Captain Hibana,
do you have any ideas on why?

20:08.332 --> 20:12.211
Crops? How is that related…

20:13.295 --> 20:15.297
<i>The convent's symbol combines</i>

20:15.380 --> 20:19.343
<i>the Holy Sol Cross</i>
<i>with vegetation and flowers.</i>

20:19.426 --> 20:22.554
<i>No… I must be reading too deeply.</i>

20:22.638 --> 20:24.890
Insect specimens.

20:24.973 --> 20:29.186
Plants and insects.
They're all perfectly normal books.

20:30.312 --> 20:35.067
<i>Each day has three meals, in the morning,</i>
<i>at noon, and in the evening.</i>

20:35.984 --> 20:41.323
Who'd make a room like this
just for books on plants and insects?

20:44.451 --> 20:47.120
<i>The meals are primarily of</i>

20:47.204 --> 20:50.249
<i>healthy, nutritious vegetables grown</i>
<i>with plentiful sunlight.</i>

20:50.332 --> 20:56.630
If the doppelganger experiments conducted
here turned the sisters into Infernals…

20:56.713 --> 21:00.676
<i>Naturally, the sisters</i>
<i>grow them all by hand.</i>

21:05.055 --> 21:09.601
But there aren't any clues on exactly
what kind of experiments they were doing.

21:10.269 --> 21:12.312
What were they doing down here?

21:12.396 --> 21:14.773
And now meal recipes?

21:25.867 --> 21:28.912
Looks like this is just document storage--

21:29.997 --> 21:30.998
What's the matter?

21:31.748 --> 21:35.836
Could it be… that all that time, we…

21:46.513 --> 21:50.684
<i>Based on the convent's</i>
<i>symbol and this practice,</i>

21:51.727 --> 21:56.440
<i>it became tradition for all of</i>
<i>the sisters to be named after plants.</i>

21:57.774 --> 21:59.484
Did you find something?!

22:00.360 --> 22:02.195
She was growing us…

22:02.946 --> 22:04.906
like crops…

22:04.990 --> 22:07.784
giving the sisters the names of flowers…

22:08.368 --> 22:10.120
What are you trying to say?

22:10.203 --> 22:11.371
Is there something down here?

22:11.455 --> 22:14.041
Giving us the names
of flowers, and insects…

22:14.124 --> 22:16.460
Insects come naturally to flowers.

22:22.424 --> 22:25.761
Sister Sumire…

22:25.844 --> 22:27.304
So you remember my name,

22:27.387 --> 22:29.639
Sister Sumire.

22:32.893 --> 22:34.728
Why are you here?

22:39.274 --> 22:42.944
TO BE CONTINUED

24:14.828 --> 24:16.997
<i>You were reading without permission again,</i>

24:17.080 --> 24:18.915
<i>Sister Hibana.</i>

24:18.999 --> 24:23.003
<i>I taught you countless times</i>
<i>to clean up after yourself.</i>

24:23.086 --> 24:24.963
<i>Next time, "Holy Mother of Darkness."</i>

24:25.046 --> 24:27.591
<i>Return to the great flame of fire.</i> Látom.
